n\n- **Tobacco Use:** The patient reports a current smoking habit of approximately five cigarettes per day, which she started in December 2016. Despite efforts to quit, she has not been successful to date. Smoking cessation resources and support are advised. \n\n- **Alcohol Consumption:** The patient consumes approximately two alcoholic drinks per week, which is within moderate limits. She is counseled on the potential impact of alcohol on overall health and advised to maintain this moderate level of consumption.\n\n**Social History:**\n\n- **Tobacco Use:** Rachel Jackson reports smoking cigarettes and currently smokes about five ci"
